 "21": {
  "tid": "21",
  "vid": "5",
  "name": "BurnoutAholics Forums",
  "description": "BurnoutAholics have voted for a Forum. So, here it is!<br/><br/> \r\nThe forum is embedded in the BurnoutAholics site, so you do not need a different user name or login password. When you log in to BurnoutAholics you are also logging into the Forum.<br/><br/> \r\nThis Forum will be moderated. The <a href=\"/node/92\" target=\"top\">Terms of Use</a> apply to the forum as do the following Rules that I learnt from my Mum.<br/><br/> \r\n\"Treat other people as you expect to be treated yourself\" and \"If you dont have anything nice to say, dont say anything at all\"<br/><br/> \r\nHowever these Rules from my Mum should be broken.<br/><br/> \r\n\"Do not speak unless spoken too\" and \"Be seen and not heard\"<br/><br/> \r\nThe only other thing to bear in mind is that BurnoutAholics.com should be a Utopia for Burners so, <i>Be Excellent to Each other and Party on Dudes!</i><br/><br/>ZombieTron",
  "vocabulary": "Forums",
  "parent": "0",
  "weight": 0
 },
